<% content_for "header" do %><title>Approve TV access - Invidious</title><% end %>
<div class="pure-g"><div class="pure-u-1 pure-u-lg-1-5"></div>
<div class="pure-u-1 pure-u-lg-3-5"><div class="h-box">
  <h1>Approve TV access</h1>
  <p>Signed in as <strong><%= HTML.escape(user.username) %></strong>.</p>
  <% if message %><p role="status"><%= HTML.escape(message) %></p><% end %>
  <% unless finished %>
    <p>Tividious will receive a native session for your account, allowing it to read and change your subscriptions, history, playlists, preferences, clips and account settings.</p>
    <p>Only approve a code currently shown on a TV you are signing into. Compare the code below with your TV. You can revoke this session later from your account session manager.</p>
    <form class="pure-form pure-form-stacked" action="/tv" method="post">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<%= HTML.escape(csrf_token) %>">
      <label for="user_code">Code shown on your TV</label>
      <input id="user_code" name="user_code" value="<%= HTML.escape(user_code) %>" maxlength="9" minlength="8" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" required>
      <button class="pure-button pure-button-primary" name="decision" value="approve" type="submit">Approve TV access</button>
      <button class="pure-button" name="decision" value="deny" type="submit">Deny</button>
    </form>
  <% end %>
</div></div></div>
